==Description==
'''Ducky Doom 3''' was a narrator that appeared in [[Bathroom Approach]]. It represented the [[Ducky D00M III]] enemy from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]].

==Appearance==
'''Ducky Doom 3''' had no actual appearance. The area in which a speaker is shown would instead always be empty.

==Trivia==
*'''Ducky Doom 3''' is incorrectly named, as it uses "''doom''" instead of "''D00M''".
**Certain dialogue spoken by '''Ducky Doom 3''' uses "''D00M''" in place of "''doom''".
*Although classified as an animated [[Narrators|narrator]], '''Ducky Doom 3''' by all practical means is not animated at all.

